  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Provides diagnostic events for XAML Incremental Hot Reload operations.
            Subscribe to these events to observe hot reload lifecycle in tooling or diagnostics overlays.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            Events are only raised when <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.RuntimeFeature.IsIncrementalHotReloadEnabled" />
            is <see langword="true" />. All events are raised on the thread where the work occurs:
            <see cref="E:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Xaml.Diagnostics.HotReloadDiagnostics.UpdateRequested" /> and <see cref="E:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Xaml.Diagnostics.HotReloadDiagnostics.UpdateSkipped" /> on the calling thread,
            <see cref="E:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Xaml.Diagnostics.HotReloadDiagnostics.UpdateApplied" /> and <see cref="E:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Xaml.Diagnostics.HotReloadDiagnostics.UpdateFailed" /> on the main/UI thread.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
